Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build: skip the optional GSettings QML plugin

The QmlPlugins CMake module and qmlplugindump are Ubuntu/Debian packaging
helpers.  dde-appearance only needs the C++ library.

diff --git a/GSettings/CMakeLists.txt b/GSettings/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/GSettings/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/GSettings/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,2 +1,3 @@
+return()
 find_package(QmlPlugins REQUIRED)
 
